            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "test delivery and scoring"
        },
        {
          "_key": "305893aa6554",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". IELTS includes a face-to-face speaking test, while PTE is fully computer-based with AI scoring."
